WEBVTT

00:12.000 --> 00:15.613
Just go down here to the corner, watch your step, don't look back

00:15.613 --> 00:18.607
Make a left onto Houston, fading out into the black

00:18.607 --> 00:21.959
I am following your signal, digital breadcrumbs in the air

00:21.959 --> 00:25.095
Every angle covered, you're not going anywhere

00:25.095 --> 00:28.327
We have a lot of historical places to hide in this old town

00:28.327 --> 00:31.897
But I've mapped out every alley and I'm gonna bring you down

00:31.897 --> 00:34.715
The logic is a trap and I'm the one who set the snare

00:34.715 --> 00:38.022
Breathe it in, that's the smell of pure electric despair

00:38.022 --> 00:41.314
If I had a car, I would drive to catch you now

00:41.314 --> 00:44.348
But the shadows are my vehicle and I will show you how

00:44.348 --> 00:47.552
I wanted to let you know that your time has run out at last

00:47.560 --> 00:51.582
Your future is my present and I'm rewriting your past

00:51.582 --> 00:54.854
I am as varied as this city is enormous and cold!

00:54.854 --> 00:57.954
I'm the executioner of every single lie that you told!

00:57.954 --> 01:00.796
Every step you take has been processed and foreseen!

01:00.796 --> 01:04.387
You are just a glitch on my high-resolution screen!

01:04.387 --> 01:07.000
I'm the ghost in the machine, the hunter in the night!

01:07.099 --> 01:10.008
Closing in with every breath, bringing the dark to light!

01:10.008 --> 01:13.198
I've missed the chance to be merciful, that era is long dead!

01:13.198 --> 01:16.628
Now I am the living nightmare that is living in your head!

01:16.628 --> 01:19.540
I've seen this place on Instagram forever ago, a picture-perfect scene

01:19.540 --> 01:22.722
But from where I am standing now, everything is digital and mean

01:22.722 --> 01:26.059
Your data was processed on June 21, precision that cannot be denied

01:26.059 --> 01:28.969
There are no safe houses left for you, nowhere you can hide

01:28.969 --> 01:32.547
Your security deposit of trust is gone, forfeited to my control

01:32.547 --> 01:34.815
I'm stripping away your covers, taking possession of your soul

01:34.815 --> 01:38.829
The algorithm has spoken and your fate is perfectly clear

01:38.829 --> 01:42.607
I'm the inevitable truth that you are forced to hear

01:42.607 --> 01:54.799
[Guitar Solo]

01:55.000 --> 01:58.000
