02:21.000 --> 02:27.000
No-frills service so as long as you're only sleeping there...

02:27.099 --> 02:33.000
You'll have no complaints in that deep, dark, and endless air

02:33.099 --> 02:36.807
Mission complete! There is nowhere left to run

02:36.807 --> 02:45.000
The ghost is in your shadow and this high-stakes game is won!
